      },
      "note": [
        "Latest year of immigrations indicates the year in which the individual was last registered in Sweden. Individuals who have never immigrated are reported in the group Missing value. This means that persons that are born in Sweden and been registered there their whole life are reported in that group. The group Missing value also contains those individuals who have immigrated to Sweden but data on time for immigration are missing."
